Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Undetermined", "ObjectName",
 CellID->186137360,ExpressionUUID->"77c88405-4389-364d-bc4a-9c434ddc465a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"26298ce5-cf10-9542-a4fc-6bc05c0c9821"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["Undetermined",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->
    "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/Undetermined"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"8ce946ec-c34a-514a-8036-01adaea7ac27"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "is the \"Satisfied\" value of a \
[ClassifyCandidate](paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
ClassifyCandidate) label whose criteria can be neither confirmed nor refuted, \
because a required metric value is Missing or failed."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->176371949,ExpressionUUID->"92dd5445-6be2-7b45-abef-1adb13dae82c"],

Cell["\<\
Classification is three-valued: a label is True when its criteria hold, False \
when some condition fails, and Undetermined when no condition fails but some \
cannot be decided, for example because a dimension estimate is \
Missing[\"InsufficientStructure\"] for small states. A decided failure takes \
precedence over a missing value.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->502954326,ExpressionUUID->"9543f29c-585a-3745-93b3-186fb77550d7"]
}, Open  ]],

